{"id":47388,"ord":100,"n_segments":152,"prev":47387,"next":47389,"doc":{"id":"61125","title":"61125_Teddy Bunn oral history interview","collection":"rutgers","inst":"Rutgers — Institute of Jazz Studies","interviewee":"Theodore Leroy Bunn","interviewer":"","date":"","year":"","source_url":"https://rucore.libraries.rutgers.edu/rutgers-lib/61125/","url":"https://thisismattmiller.github.io/linked-jazz-2026-transcripts/?t=61125"},"chapter":"Hampton, Blue Note and the electric guitar","title":"Keeping the guitar heard in Hampton's small group","category":"music_technique_style","summary":"Against vibes and piano in Hampton's quartet he used higher notes to be heard.","period":"1940","year_from":1940,"year_to":1940,"words":113,"start":[185,9],"end":[186,9],"url":"https://thisismattmiller.github.io/linked-jazz-2026-transcripts/?t=61125#s47388","tags":{"places":[],"venues":[],"bands":[{"name":"Lionel Hampton combo","focus":1,"leader":"Lionel Hampton"}]},"people":[{"name":"Lionel Hampton","qid":"Q313525","n":1}],"story":{"theme":12,"theme_name":"Banjo, guitar and the rhythm section: instruments and players","community":21,"community_name":"Banjo, guitar and the rhythm section's changing role","core":true},"blocks":[{"p":185,"b":9,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Especially with Lionel. Wasn't that about a seven or eight piece -- it was like a small band, wasn't it? I mean a small --"},{"p":185,"b":10,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"He had four."},{"p":185,"b":11,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Oh, it was a combo?"},{"p":185,"b":12,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah."},{"p":185,"b":13,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Oh, I see. I thought it was bigger than that, four."},{"p":185,"b":14,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"No."},{"p":185,"b":15,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"But even so, if --"},{"p":185,"b":16,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"When I was working with him, you mean?"},{"p":185,"b":17,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Yeah."},{"p":185,"b":18,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"He had four."},{"p":186,"b":0,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"But still, with vibes and piano both --"},{"p":186,"b":1,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah."},{"p":186,"b":2,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"-- the guitar could really get drowned out."},{"p":186,"b":3,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"I know it."},{"p":186,"b":4,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Yeah. Because you're in the same area."},{"p":186,"b":5,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah."},{"p":186,"b":6,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Middle register."},{"p":186,"b":7,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"But I kept it a lot different, because I had them high notes."},{"p":186,"b":8,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Yeah, right. Using higher notes."},{"p":186,"b":9,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"That's right."}]}